      "created_at": "2012-12-01T02:11:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don't use oversized villain cards in my games because I can't sleeves for them. OCD I know, but I love my sentinels cards.</p><p>Since cgrater pointed out to me ultra pro soft sleeves do have oversized size, I have been wanting to get them. Then came the next question, how many sleeves to get and to share with my friends who also own sentinels?</p><p>Essentially, the question is, how many villains will there be until the end of sentinels? Hope that some designers can shed some light. :)</p>",
