      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/59ef9b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-01T02:25:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>As far as I know, the soft sleeves only come in packs of 100 - that should be enough for forever.</p><p>(Note that the ultra pro soft sleeves are only slightly thicker than penny sleeves. &nbsp;This should be fine for the villain cards, since they don't get shuffled).</p>",
