      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/59ef9b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-01T12:22:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hmmm...</p><p>That would leave you space for 24 more villains each, &nbsp;That's 6 expansions. &nbsp;If each expansion also comes with a promo villain, it will still be enough for 5 expansions. &nbsp;At the release rate of 1 expansion per year, will you even be able to find where you put the rest of the sleeves in 5 more years? (I certainly wouldn't)</p>",
